r skills (technical). Concern: pretentious, sometimes wrong tone (crew cooperation). Explain why strengths outweigh concerns.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 1's recommendation and argue why we think B is better overall.\n\nThus produce public message: \"I appreciate Agent 1's points, but I think B is stronger overall because of stress resilience and reliability, which are critical, while C lacks evidence on those and has organization concerns.\"\n\nMake sure to include explicit facts.\n\nNow produce output."}
