emains strongest.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 1 and 3, continue to recommend B, because of his reliability, stress handling, weather assessment, computer skills, and that his communication issues are less critical than C's lack of responsibility and adaptability, and A's communication issues and lack of willingness to learn. Also note we still need to gather info on D's reliability and stress, but currently B is best.\n\nProvide vote in metadata: Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
